{"v":2,"catch":"在野獸與人交融的南國，為妳獻上一段熱烈刺激的戀情——","desc":"主人公「天野凪咲」某日救助了路邊受傷的動物。\n\n帶回家後卻發現牠的傷口早已癒合。\n當她滿腹疑惑地推開房門，\n眼前世界竟成了通往永夏異界的通道——？！\n\n在誤闖自稱「獸人」的族群的領域後，\n她被迫成為這場「遊戲」中\n不可或缺的「關鍵棋子」。\n\n此處是甜膩炙熱、足以將妳融化的南方國度。\n在充斥危險慾望與熾烈情愫的獸人居所，\n屬於妳的戀愛博弈即將揭幕。","publisher":"Game Source Entertainment","release":"2026-01-22","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 3.6GB / Switch 3.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e334a51b35dda569e1ddd38a6e758332c37965953d83809c20da132b49e17621.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/315fd058e81066d139b1a8a86e34a406498b00582048d164d831acced2ace9c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca05a44696086bab911ba9d835f165e2762ffd25cd93f8397bef800def1231bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f706709a9c2f29a8e0df18ef85fd93ae3b8c6a33cf941cca67a40973d95bbe7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2ce4b4a0e1a8322d3697728db330ad920aaf586d2b5c3eeb5197284be91a6e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8463d0a0c6bb3fc1e7ba2ebcf2952fafd26fff6c92d54359e08f1f6d61f2f0e.jpg"],"titleId":"010050a024eaa000"}